{
  "description": "std-tree — generic hierarchical node browser. Fetches a flat TreeNode collection and renders it through file-tree's flat `items` mode (parentId-nested at render time by the component, not the .lolo); OPEN_NODE is the external handoff for a selected node's id. Rebindable: pass `fields` at the call site to retarget it at any parent-pointer entity (categories, org units, comment threads). Search/filter are wired (REFETCH_QUERY/REFETCH_FILTER re-fetch the flat node set server-side); pagination is deliberately NOT offered — a hierarchy is not a paged list, and paging a flat node set would sever children from parents that fell on another page.",
  "ledger": {
    "entries": {
      "ent_01M0RYHNM1NXR2J5S0HK2WFDS3": {
        "bakedName": "TreeNode",
